<title>USA: Resource Bank sets $0.25 special dividend.</title>
<headline>Resource Bank sets $0.25 special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>VIRGINIA BEACH, Va. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource Bank said said Thursday it approved a one-time dividend of $0.25 per share, subject to the approval of the bank's shareholders at the mid-summer annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>Resource said this dividend is a 250 percent increase over the prior year's dividend of $0.10 per share and was based on the record earnings of 1996.</p>
</text>
